<title>UK: Havelock Europa H1 pretax profit down.</title>
<headline>Havelock Europa H1 pretax profit down.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		5.1		    vs 5.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.45		   vs 1.20</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.01		   vs 2.05</p>
<p> Turnover		   25.0		   vs 22.79</p>
<p> Operating profit	 2.05		   vs 1.89</p>
<p> Pay date		   Dec 27</p>
<p>Div registration date  Nov 19</p>
<p>NOTE - UK manufacturer of shop and bank interiors Havelock Europa Plc said the costs associated with new product and consumer development will constrain profitability in 1996.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
